      <marc:subfield code="a">Since its release over a decade ago, The Power of Listening has been widely circulated and continuously featured by major media outlets. After being compiled into book form, it has gone through multiple reprints, becoming a unique and influential &quot;book of life’s questions and answers&quot; in the history of Chinese publishing. Countless readers have found wisdom and inspiration within its pages. As you open this book, you’ll discover that the loneliness, confusion, and life struggles you’ve experienced have all been encountered by the people in these stories. Their journeys toward mental maturity, their life experiences, and the way they express themselves will bring you clarity—and fill you with courage and hope for life</marc:subfield>
